  "critical_engineering_findings": [
    {
      "category": "SOT-223-3 Pinout & Thermal Tab Split",
      "finding": "7 SOT-223-3 parts divide into TWO mutually destructive pinouts: (A) Classic 1117 family (1=GND, 2/Tab=VOUT, 3=VIN): AMS1117-3.3, LM1117IMPX-3.3/NOPB, AZ1117CH-3.3TRG1, NCP1117ST33T3G, TLV1117-33IDCYR; (B) Classic 78xx/2937/AP-E family (1=VIN, 2/Tab=GND, 3=VOUT): LM2937IMP-3.3/NOPB and AP7361C-33E-13. Swapping between groups shorts VOUT to GND through the tab! Note AP7361C requires the 'ER' suffix (AP7361C-33ER-13) for 1117 pinout, and AZ1117C has an incompatible 'H2' suffix."
    },
    {
      "category": "SOT-223-3 ESR & Ceramic Capacitor Stability",
      "finding": "AMS1117-3.3 (22 uF solid tantalum, no numeric ESR), LM1117IMPX-3.3/NOPB (10 uF tantalum, 0.3–22 ohm ESR), NCP1117ST33T3G (4.7 uF, 0.033–2.2 ohm ESR), and LM2937IMP-3.3/NOPB (10 uF, 0.01–3.0 ohm ESR) are NOT directly stable with standard low-ESR MLCCs (<10 mOhm). By contrast, AZ1117CH-3.3TRG1 (10 uF, 0–20 ohm), AP7361C-33E-13 (2.2 uF, 0–10 ohm), and New-Chip TLV1117-33IDCYR (1 uF, 0.002–0.5 ohm) are ceramic-cap stable."
    },
    {
      "category": "TI Dual-Silicon Transitions (Legacy vs. New Chip)",
      "finding": "Three TI OPNs (TPS73633DBVR, LP2985-33DBVR, TLV1117-33IDCYR) ship mixed legacy vs. new silicon under non-M3 OPNs. Most dramatically, TLV1117-33IDCYR Legacy (CSO:SFB) draws 5 mA IQ & demands 0.2–10 ohm tantalum, while New Chip (CSO:RFB/FFAB) draws 65 uA IQ & caps ESR at <=0.5 ohm (leaving a narrow 0.2–0.5 ohm overlap window for mixed inventory)."
    },
    {
      "category": "SOT-23-5 / TSOT-23-5 Pin 4 Role & HV Enable Trap",
      "finding": "Pin 4 is BYPASS/NR on TPS73633DBVR, LP2985-33DBVR, and CAT6219-330TD-GT3, versus NC on NCP500SN33T1G and TPS70933DBVR. On TPS70933DBVR (30 V VIN / 32 V abs max), Pin 3 EN has an internal 6.5 V Zener clamp (7 V abs max) — tying EN to VIN > 6.5 V destroys the IC."
    },
    {
      "category": "Lifecycle, Datasheet Split & Package Derating Catches",
      "finding": "Vision check caught CAT6219-330TD-GT3 full-page OBSOLETE watermark (EOL); resolved LP2985-33DBVR to TI native lp2985.pdf (SLVS522S) instead of National lp2985-n.pdf; caught LM2937IMP-3.3/NOPB SOT-223-specific derating to 400 mA max & +85°C recommended TJ (vs 500 mA / 125°C in TO-220); caught commercial/narrow min temp grades on NCP1117ST33T3G (0°C) and AZ1117CH-3.3TRG1 (-20°C)."
    }
